[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:After the Elections]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.65]Why did Patrick keep on asking the same question? | 为什么帕特里克不断地问同一个问题？
[00:16.90]The former Prime Minister, Mr. Wentworth Lane, was defeated in the recent elections. | 前首相温特沃斯·莱恩先生在最近的大选中被击败了。
[00:24.64]He is now retiring from political life and has gone abroad. | 他现在退出了政界，到国外去了。
[00:30.50]My friend, Patrick, has always been a fanatical opponent of Mr. Lane's Radical Progressive Party. | 我的朋友帕特里克一直是莱恩先生激进党的狂热反对者。
[00:39.87]After the elections, Patrick went to the former Prime Minister's house. | 大选结束后，帕特里克来到了前首相的家里。
[00:46.36]When he asked if Mr. Lane lived there, the policeman on duty told him that since his defeat, the ex-Prime Minister had gone abroad. | 当他询问莱恩先生是否住在那里时，值班的警察告诉他，落选后这位前首相已经出国了。
[00:58.53]On the following day Patrick went to the house again. | 第二天帕特里克又去了那个家。
[01:03.77]The same policeman was just walking slowly past the entrance, when Patrick asked the same question. | 还是那位警察正慢悠悠地从门前走过，帕特里克又问了同样的问题。
[01:12.83]Though a little suspicious this time the policeman gave him the same answer. | 虽然这次有点怀疑，警察还是给了他同样的回答。
[01:20.10]The day after, Patrick went to the house once more and asked exactly the same question. | 第三天，帕特里克又一次去了那里，问的还是同一个问题。
[01:29.64]This time, the policeman lost his temper. | 这次警察火了。
[01:34.34]'I told you yesterday and the day before yesterday,' he shouted, | “我昨天和前天都告诉过您了，”他喊道，
[01:41.65]'Mr.Lane was defeated in the elections. | “莱恩先生在大选中被击败了。
[01:45.66]He has retired from political life and gone to live abroad!' | 他已经退出政界，到国外定居去了！”
[01:52.00]'I know,' answered Patrick,' but I love to hear you say it!' | “这我知道，”帕特里克回答说，“可我就是爱听您说这些话！”
